==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 40~66.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~12 seconds<sup>90f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~12 seconds<sup>90f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
As with all stages in this subchapter, Moonlight Beach isn't very difficult. A simple lineup that could clear [[Lycopene Sunset]] is all that is really necessary here.

